# J.A.R.V.I.S. - secrets template. Copy to <HERMES_HOME>/profiles/jarvis/.env and uncomment only what you use.
# All entries are optional and commented out on purpose: a blank `KEY=` line can shadow a value
# inherited from your shell. Never commit a real .env. Model auth is NOT set here
# (use `hermes -p jarvis auth add <provider>` or the Claude CLI login; see README).

# Text-to-speech (only if tts.provider: elevenlabs is actually used)
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
# Tavily-backed web search (optional)
# TAVILY_API_KEY=
# Context7 MCP: optional. Only used if you also enable the commented `headers:` block under
# mcp_servers.context7 in config.yaml (the variable alone sends nothing).
# CONTEXT7_API_KEY=
# Only if you enable the gemini fallback provider
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
